# text
seg-015e3cff4eda = Kshana is an open-source simulator for PNT (positioning, navigation and timing) resilience. Replay jamming, spoofing and clock holdover when GNSS (Global Navigation Satellite System) signals fail, in a Rust engine that runs right in your browser, and see exactly which results were checked against independent references.

