seg-253c54ae2238 = Not RF signal-generator hardware<s1>It drives no radio and transmits nothing; its signal-level output is baseband IQ sample files for software receivers.</s1>

# text
seg-4fe725162c1c = Not a hardware or certified GNSS receiver<s1>Its software receiver (acquisition and tracking on recorded or generated IQ) is an analysis tool, not a navigation product.</s1>

# text
